{"2026.5.8:P01-Q05":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>铍铝化学相似性与晶体类型</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.5.8 · 长沙市一中四月阶段检测 · 原题5 · P01-Q05</div><h1>铍铝化学相似性与晶体类型</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：物质结构与性质/分子结构与性质/配合物</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：比较氨配位、氯化物熔点、两性氢氧化物和氢化物遇酸。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">常见无机物及其应用/铝及其化合物/氢氧化铝</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/晶体结构与性质/常见几种晶体类型</span><span class=\"tag\">常见无机物及其应用/金属资源的开发与金属材料/其他金属及其化合物</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/盐类的水解/盐类水解原理</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>5. <img src=\"chem-asset:cb83da09b2ee8171d4c5af1c3251fad55328d29296d22ee05b1dc1532ad3946d:0;\" style=\"width:33.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:891485df6503d3f69f4bce0f97f3d04233b416046f75a292ecf7c1162b174b9e:1;\" style=\"width:29.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的电荷与半径之比相近，导致两元素性质相似。下列说法错误的是</p><p>A. <img src=\"chem-asset:cb83da09b2ee8171d4c5af1c3251fad55328d29296d22ee05b1dc1532ad3946d:0;\" style=\"width:33.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">与<img src=\"chem-asset:891485df6503d3f69f4bce0f97f3d04233b416046f75a292ecf7c1162b174b9e:1;\" style=\"width:29.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">都能在水中与氨形成配合物</p><p>B. <img src=\"chem-asset:62f1cab5fbe341023426faaa22030b59ccf976f3609c76b45dddd8f992c61a70:2;\" style=\"width:43.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:68ba33490197b7e5616e646a685e1b739571064561c80c9211cf756f4e48db9b:3;\" style=\"width:36.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的熔点都比<img src=\"chem-asset:27edf8837d84f99ee85df91391de054f173c48047e0617fa5a18a9db0227b671:4;\" style=\"width:48.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的低</p><p>C. <img src=\"chem-asset:f077f87300521abf32af70b84717392bffb793236ea5ced53928bb6d4aa373df:5;\" style=\"width:65.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:c13aded393e1814a0a4e66a8c8f1a53b4855193c7d2037ff48c147a4573eb438:6;\" style=\"width:62.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">均可表现出弱酸性</p><p>D. <img src=\"chem-asset:16df2c28f6832b6c32cb9c7408464e1e48628c6e845c270a18dcc339b515fabf:7;\" style=\"width:22.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:8a9f6586a61d0da23ae92e3632926da8e09a7aaedb971858ac14239a86f4f93e:8;\" style=\"width:21.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的氢化物都不能在酸中稳定存在</p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】A</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【详解】A．Al<sup>3+</sup>与氨水反应只能生成氢氧化铝沉淀，不能与氨形成配合物，同理Be<sup>2+</sup>也不能在水中与氨形成配合物，A项错误；</p><p>B．<img src=\"chem-asset:62f1cab5fbe341023426faaa22030b59ccf976f3609c76b45dddd8f992c61a70:2;\" style=\"width:43.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:68ba33490197b7e5616e646a685e1b739571064561c80c9211cf756f4e48db9b:3;\" style=\"width:36.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">属于分子晶体，而<img src=\"chem-asset:27edf8837d84f99ee85df91391de054f173c48047e0617fa5a18a9db0227b671:4;\" style=\"width:48.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">属于离子晶体，则<img src=\"chem-asset:62f1cab5fbe341023426faaa22030b59ccf976f3609c76b45dddd8f992c61a70:2;\" style=\"width:43.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:68ba33490197b7e5616e646a685e1b739571064561c80c9211cf756f4e48db9b:3;\" style=\"width:36.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的熔点都比<img src=\"chem-asset:27edf8837d84f99ee85df91391de054f173c48047e0617fa5a18a9db0227b671:4;\" style=\"width:48.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的低，B项正确；</p><p>C．<img src=\"chem-asset:f077f87300521abf32af70b84717392bffb793236ea5ced53928bb6d4aa373df:9;\" style=\"width:65.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:c13aded393e1814a0a4e66a8c8f1a53b4855193c7d2037ff48c147a4573eb438:10;\" style=\"width:63.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">均为两性氢氧化物，则均可表现出弱酸性，C项正确；</p><p>D．<img src=\"chem-asset:16df2c28f6832b6c32cb9c7408464e1e48628c6e845c270a18dcc339b515fabf:7;\" style=\"width:22.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:8a9f6586a61d0da23ae92e3632926da8e09a7aaedb971858ac14239a86f4f93e:8;\" style=\"width:21.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的氢化物与酸反应，生成对应的盐和氢气，则都不能在酸中稳定存在，D项正确；</p><p>答案选A。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.5.8\\精品解析：湖南长沙市第一中学2025-2026学年高三下学期4月阶段检测 化学试题\\精品解析：湖南长沙市第一中学2025-2026学年高三下学期4月阶段检测 化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.5.8/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62025-2026%E5%AD%A6%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F4%E6%9C%88%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62025-2026%E5%AD%A6%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F4%E6%9C%88%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["16df2c28f6832b6c32cb9c7408464e1e48628c6e845c270a18dcc339b515fabf","27edf8837d84f99ee85df91391de054f173c48047e0617fa5a18a9db0227b671","62f1cab5fbe341023426faaa22030b59ccf976f3609c76b45dddd8f992c61a70","68ba33490197b7e5616e646a685e1b739571064561c80c9211cf756f4e48db9b","891485df6503d3f69f4bce0f97f3d04233b416046f75a292ecf7c1162b174b9e","8a9f6586a61d0da23ae92e3632926da8e09a7aaedb971858ac14239a86f4f93e","c13aded393e1814a0a4e66a8c8f1a53b4855193c7d2037ff48c147a4573eb438","cb83da09b2ee8171d4c5af1c3251fad55328d29296d22ee05b1dc1532ad3946d","f077f87300521abf32af70b84717392bffb793236ea5ced53928bb6d4aa373df"],"refs":{"chem-asset:cb83da09b2ee8171d4c5af1c3251fad55328d29296d22ee05b1dc1532ad3946d:0;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/c974e4c0ba580c6541e4de3a.png","chem-asset:891485df6503d3f69f4bce0f97f3d04233b416046f75a292ecf7c1162b174b9e:1;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/3c1b17b4292fe93f862a24ca.png","chem-asset:62f1cab5fbe341023426faaa22030b59ccf976f3609c76b45dddd8f992c61a70:2;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/981061c281c307de6adab6f9.png","chem-asset:68ba33490197b7e5616e646a685e1b739571064561c80c9211cf756f4e48db9b:3;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/bcef883f46273a69506bfa8c.png","chem-asset:27edf8837d84f99ee85df91391de054f173c48047e0617fa5a18a9db0227b671:4;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/b26fe914f2efda162f361e24.png","chem-asset:f077f87300521abf32af70b84717392bffb793236ea5ced53928bb6d4aa373df:5;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/fa65746645f81e76b4aeb1bd.png","chem-asset:c13aded393e1814a0a4e66a8c8f1a53b4855193c7d2037ff48c147a4573eb438:6;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/b1302ecd88b59d26620a1d09.png","chem-asset:16df2c28f6832b6c32cb9c7408464e1e48628c6e845c270a18dcc339b515fabf:7;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/9f426d47174afac8007932f3.png","chem-asset:8a9f6586a61d0da23ae92e3632926da8e09a7aaedb971858ac14239a86f4f93e:8;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/c493e9c96875e8aba6e29619.png","chem-asset:f077f87300521abf32af70b84717392bffb793236ea5ced53928bb6d4aa373df:9;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/9f127b9d35c35c8a40e2770d.png","chem-asset:c13aded393e1814a0a4e66a8c8f1a53b4855193c7d2037ff48c147a4573eb438:10;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/f0e2415903a2a47c74c4b690.png"},"sourceSha256":"d0be616c003766261bf83f735e205bd080de1cf97dfdb8aaa7fbc22e832d4138","bom":false,"legacyPath":"物质结构与性质/分子结构与性质/配合物/2026.5.8/P01-Q05_铍铝化学相似性与晶体类型.html"},"2026.5.8:P01-Q08":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>滕氏蓝晶胞与分数坐标</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.5.8 · 长沙市一中四月阶段检测 · 原题8 · P01-Q08</div><h1>滕氏蓝晶胞与分数坐标</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：物质结构与性质/晶体结构与性质/晶体常识</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：结合配位原子、晶胞坐标、最近距离和密度计算。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/分子结构与性质/配合物</span><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/物质的量/物质的量及单位——摩尔</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/晶体结构与性质/常见几种晶体类型</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>8. <img src=\"chem-asset:8ab3ba859eb2b028c73431d1b2ecfa456fe530fc425cc0fc6ffed0cc54f0738d:0;\" style=\"width:99.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">(铁氰化钾)可用于检验<img src=\"chem-asset:f2c7ad6a8fcf0daef188ccad5646a630a9952afac88945218d33c7591871e3e2:1;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，产生特征蓝色沉淀<img src=\"chem-asset:ea94256717c79a25fa27d7772ab08581a29b77549def4773d9fe3cc9c8c484b7:2;\" style=\"width:108.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">(滕氏蓝)，滕氏蓝可作蓝色颜料。滕氏蓝晶体的晶胞结构如图(正方体结构，省略了<img src=\"chem-asset:2dfb87473f9196dbaf225c76089e34478db98401a0c02b6444caf4b29ea89d85:3;\" style=\"width:29.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">)，晶胞边长为d nm，P原子坐标为<img src=\"chem-asset:edfd8d01c3916b477891ae2c7e6af28fcd3a899ee7ce3c860e6ee1da5b34f0e8:4;\" style=\"width:52.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">。</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:0d912f01f432e2a228b27c33c7570046ebc2d1d5025fa66b7ea3dde2faab6b99:5;\" style=\"width:258.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>已知：<img src=\"chem-asset:a360bc1e5723e235257b2c6057fc94895f5502efc40f373a90cf4094bb67e839:6;\" style=\"width:103.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的摩尔质量为<img src=\"chem-asset:d0bf90969de0422d37f0c0f454f34e6bf74e0be531c9f5c2a36f2059e2083b19:7;\" style=\"width:69.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">。</p><p>下列说法正确的是</p><p>A. <img src=\"chem-asset:1fa3483e0a18f86c49bfbb059087f7be71d3dd9084dd6cfb3816af384c53ef6d:8;\" style=\"width:89.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">中提供孤电子对形成配位键的原子为N</p><p>B. Q处<img src=\"chem-asset:aa4ce4ca369de9a9a7159ca5d340b4345d42815d5a233255e135fdd03c7901d1:9;\" style=\"width:22.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">坐标为<img src=\"chem-asset:09cfb47915df22aaae619a072c7f8d7ecec0053e61e1b091dc2c57d01622afd5:10;\" style=\"width:68.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>C. <img src=\"chem-asset:f2c7ad6a8fcf0daef188ccad5646a630a9952afac88945218d33c7591871e3e2:1;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:aa4ce4ca369de9a9a7159ca5d340b4345d42815d5a233255e135fdd03c7901d1:9;\" style=\"width:22.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的最近距离为<img src=\"chem-asset:8b4f6cc8b41da39d69d354ce4ab1b09567791ca61d735ce65321c9e76882fc7e:11;\" style=\"width:57.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>D. 滕氏蓝晶体的密度为<img src=\"chem-asset:323f222a288717bce96afec4bb6e8b3c9456ffd208ec3580d24414fb6a1e05c5:12;\" style=\"width:128.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】C</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【详解】A．<img src=\"chem-asset:da880ec61e11d48e63c9a5a861f4ecc0a4f291ad9d8ca0d5892fbecc17d35265:13;\" style=\"width:91.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">中配体为<img src=\"chem-asset:2dfb87473f9196dbaf225c76089e34478db98401a0c02b6444caf4b29ea89d85:3;\" style=\"width:29.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，配体中C、N均有孤电子对，但C电负性更小，更容易提供孤电子对，因此配位原子是C，A错误；</p><p>B．晶胞结构为正方体，已知P原子位于坐标原点(0,0,0)，Q点K<sup>+</sup>处于晶胞体对角线上，与x-z平面右上角原子相连，故其坐标为<img src=\"chem-asset:4b11181a9cf203d46e026fa47fe16e051f98de21ed6f2452957864c75f36f9d6:14;\" style=\"width:68.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，B错误；</p><p>C．晶胞结构中可以发现所有钾离子位于立方体中其中的4个小立方体的体心，而距离其中一个钾离子最近的亚铁离子其实是小立方体的顶点，故最短距离是“小立方体的体对角线的一半”，即立方体的体对角线的<img src=\"chem-asset:60d453b09cad97c22156362a8cd7c11a88ca0909b107aafa0722850c24671a1b:15;\" style=\"width:16.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">。已知立方体的边长是d nm，则体对角线长度为<img src=\"chem-asset:c5c8535b9033a98e3a6f162ee58ccba0da1a3032370028d778c750bcbc64f573:16;\" style=\"width:51.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，故亚铁离子和钾离子的最短距离是<img src=\"chem-asset:9645ac144eac396205ddb0c41e58269c24d33ae26fbd4ece966dc91931d2c8e8:17;\" style=\"width:57.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，C正确；</p><p>D．晶体密度与晶胞计算公式为<img src=\"chem-asset:430c803633415137d17f7a1716c3758a497e8ba30e37b0ef34b64240b1d5f7c3:18;\" style=\"width:92.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，根据晶胞结构可确定，<img src=\"chem-asset:aa4ce4ca369de9a9a7159ca5d340b4345d42815d5a233255e135fdd03c7901d1:19;\" style=\"width:23.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的个数为4，铁氰化钾单元数为4，则<img src=\"chem-asset:e8238d9c3958a91c37f2187185d3041ef9a44f3fbc3d71900f54832da05793d8:20;\" style=\"width:60.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，晶胞的边长为d nm即<img src=\"chem-asset:0edc56942132b1e8b448f2813f46a12def6bd72095e4af88df717b61fbbf0d56:21;\" style=\"width:72.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，则<img src=\"chem-asset:88455f66f33436501335746b5df36390171355070186f3abab1f3822d67a8a12:22;\" style=\"width:124.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，故密度为<img src=\"chem-asset:29c5164e81cbe5b0f7fd140af07832c5b8a5f639450138ceba2b38bea959e0c6:23;\" style=\"width:127.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，D错误。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.5.8\\精品解析：湖南长沙市第一中学2025-2026学年高三下学期4月阶段检测 化学试题\\精品解析：湖南长沙市第一中学2025-2026学年高三下学期4月阶段检测 化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.5.8/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62025-2026%E5%AD%A6%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F4%E6%9C%88%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62025-2026%E5%AD%A6%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F4%E6%9C%88%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["09cfb47915df22aaae619a072c7f8d7ecec0053e61e1b091dc2c57d01622afd5","0d912f01f432e2a228b27c33c7570046ebc2d1d5025fa66b7ea3dde2faab6b99","0edc56942132b1e8b448f2813f46a12def6bd72095e4af88df717b61fbbf0d56","1fa3483e0a18f86c49bfbb059087f7be71d3dd9084dd6cfb3816af384c53ef6d","29c5164e81cbe5b0f7fd140af07832c5b8a5f639450138ceba2b38bea959e0c6","2dfb87473f9196dbaf225c76089e34478db98401a0c02b6444caf4b29ea89d85","323f222a288717bce96afec4bb6e8b3c9456ffd208ec3580d24414fb6a1e05c5","430c803633415137d17f7a1716c3758a497e8ba30e37b0ef34b64240b1d5f7c3","4b11181a9cf203d46e026fa47fe16e051f98de21ed6f2452957864c75f36f9d6","60d453b09cad97c22156362a8cd7c11a88ca0909b107aafa0722850c24671a1b","88455f66f33436501335746b5df36390171355070186f3abab1f3822d67a8a12","8ab3ba859eb2b028c73431d1b2ecfa456fe530fc425cc0fc6ffed0cc54f0738d","8b4f6cc8b41da39d69d354ce4ab1b09567791ca61d735ce65321c9e76882fc7e","9645ac144eac396205ddb0c41e58269c24d33ae26fbd4ece966dc91931d2c8e8","a360bc1e5723e235257b2c6057fc94895f5502efc40f373a90cf4094bb67e839","aa4ce4ca369de9a9a7159ca5d340b4345d42815d5a233255e135fdd03c7901d1","c5c8535b9033a98e3a6f162ee58ccba0da1a3032370028d778c750bcbc64f573","d0bf90969de0422d37f0c0f454f34e6bf74e0be531c9f5c2a36f2059e2083b19","da880ec61e11d48e63c9a5a861f4ecc0a4f291ad9d8ca0d5892fbecc17d35265","e8238d9c3958a91c37f2187185d3041ef9a44f3fbc3d71900f54832da05793d8","ea94256717c79a25fa27d7772ab08581a29b77549def4773d9fe3cc9c8c484b7","edfd8d01c3916b477891ae2c7e6af28fcd3a899ee7ce3c860e6ee1da5b34f0e8","f2c7ad6a8fcf0daef188ccad5646a630a9952afac88945218d33c7591871e3e2"],"refs":{"chem-asset:8ab3ba859eb2b028c73431d1b2ecfa456fe530fc425cc0fc6ffed0cc54f0738d:0;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/c24fb1faa2f825285fe3b600.png","chem-asset:f2c7ad6a8fcf0daef188ccad5646a630a9952afac88945218d33c7591871e3e2:1;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/cc5fb5aa2ff8894afc751fbb.png","chem-asset:ea94256717c79a25fa27d7772ab08581a29b77549def4773d9fe3cc9c8c484b7:2;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/ec9aceb55de33603857b4b9b.png","chem-asset:2dfb87473f9196dbaf225c76089e34478db98401a0c02b6444caf4b29ea89d85:3;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/8d62017c4b1c10c4aad32d41.png","chem-asset:edfd8d01c3916b477891ae2c7e6af28fcd3a899ee7ce3c860e6ee1da5b34f0e8:4;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/60e62ae07a581fba60ab2e2f.png","chem-asset:0d912f01f432e2a228b27c33c7570046ebc2d1d5025fa66b7ea3dde2faab6b99:5;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/0d912f01f432e2a228b27c33.png","chem-asset:a360bc1e5723e235257b2c6057fc94895f5502efc40f373a90cf4094bb67e839:6;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/7e865ae0b8ed7810ec4fee2f.png","chem-asset:d0bf90969de0422d37f0c0f454f34e6bf74e0be531c9f5c2a36f2059e2083b19:7;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/1ccbd28a01b3759c4e8ae351.png","chem-asset:1fa3483e0a18f86c49bfbb059087f7be71d3dd9084dd6cfb3816af384c53ef6d:8;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/5905dddfd289e7280c02f9bf.png","chem-asset:aa4ce4ca369de9a9a7159ca5d340b4345d42815d5a233255e135fdd03c7901d1:9;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/afee6f7be442216963848844.png","chem-asset:09cfb47915df22aaae619a072c7f8d7ecec0053e61e1b091dc2c57d01622afd5:10;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/7182909b9cf2cfb7c2350742.png","chem-asset:8b4f6cc8b41da39d69d354ce4ab1b09567791ca61d735ce65321c9e76882fc7e:11;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/4410f3c523840b35c64acbb9.png","chem-asset:323f222a288717bce96afec4bb6e8b3c9456ffd208ec3580d24414fb6a1e05c5:12;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/de048939f794a142f21d9f1c.png","chem-asset:da880ec61e11d48e63c9a5a861f4ecc0a4f291ad9d8ca0d5892fbecc17d35265:13;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/8df4aa06ff33be817b7941cf.png","chem-asset:4b11181a9cf203d46e026fa47fe16e051f98de21ed6f2452957864c75f36f9d6:14;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/3b4e48696845d8c7ae2f5579.png","chem-asset:60d453b09cad97c22156362a8cd7c11a88ca0909b107aafa0722850c24671a1b:15;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/2f47b26d4bd6b61cca7c6076.png","chem-asset:c5c8535b9033a98e3a6f162ee58ccba0da1a3032370028d778c750bcbc64f573:16;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/c10f92331d266a3ede08ee35.png","chem-asset:9645ac144eac396205ddb0c41e58269c24d33ae26fbd4ece966dc91931d2c8e8:17;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/767f094186ed579cc1279b7c.png","chem-asset:430c803633415137d17f7a1716c3758a497e8ba30e37b0ef34b64240b1d5f7c3:18;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/37651f054ab4475b12548f7f.png","chem-asset:aa4ce4ca369de9a9a7159ca5d340b4345d42815d5a233255e135fdd03c7901d1:19;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/c9b73dfac6636ed3c3cae898.png","chem-asset:e8238d9c3958a91c37f2187185d3041ef9a44f3fbc3d71900f54832da05793d8:20;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/e8fce3ecd90c990155dfbe1e.png","chem-asset:0edc56942132b1e8b448f2813f46a12def6bd72095e4af88df717b61fbbf0d56:21;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/b1287980abe7d22006db386d.png","chem-asset:88455f66f33436501335746b5df36390171355070186f3abab1f3822d67a8a12:22;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/4a0ae74667d4f2266dd90e6b.png","chem-asset:29c5164e81cbe5b0f7fd140af07832c5b8a5f639450138ceba2b38bea959e0c6:23;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/b71980d68a326ad43ba82c87.png"},"sourceSha256":"1a3695fb60f3ea73241f13849163e95cc30cd6cf326fde3d71aba60f4a17d358","bom":false,"legacyPath":"物质结构与性质/晶体结构与性质/晶体常识/2026.5.8/P01-Q08_滕氏蓝晶胞与分数坐标.html"},"2026.5.8:P01-Q11":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>铅精矿的铅银分离与精炼</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.5.8 · 长沙市一中四月阶段检测 · 原题11 · P01-Q11</div><h1>铅精矿的铅银分离与精炼</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：化学实验基础/物质的分离、提纯</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：分析氯配位热浸、氧化剂循环、置换试剂和电解精炼。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/氧化还原反应/氧化还原反应基本概念</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/分子结构与性质/配合物</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/电解池</span><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/氧化还原反应/氧化还原反应的应用/氧化还原反应方程式的书写与配平</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>11. 以铅精矿(含<img src=\"chem-asset:c126949c8e90db2f25af844ac67fcc1731c45505f8cb254f4d25291f0aa76f1e:0;\" style=\"width:31.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:927164707f7efbdda87f2bd141b6d3da020024e2a328962c8d01040439306ac9:1;\" style=\"width:39.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">等)为原料提取金属<img src=\"chem-asset:054b7a4aa2b78fa7eb1fc4fadf9cf79ea365fe725f1880424f903850ca9de475:2;\" style=\"width:22.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:a12c5dc927d8fb99210cb5ba8898aab8c2f75b2ec4c53e6a86be445af4bc6fcc:3;\" style=\"width:24.93px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的工艺流程如下：</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:d8389be1353909d920d18d45917c59f4b10560d139038439817a3d377a1d9449:4;\" style=\"width:550.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>已知：“热浸”时，难溶的<img src=\"chem-asset:c126949c8e90db2f25af844ac67fcc1731c45505f8cb254f4d25291f0aa76f1e:0;\" style=\"width:31.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:927164707f7efbdda87f2bd141b6d3da020024e2a328962c8d01040439306ac9:1;\" style=\"width:39.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">转化为<img src=\"chem-asset:2e2730935ff22fea1c9ef3224b95ba2eaf14215989ea99a480ec1c0686b084d9:5;\" style=\"width:65.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:e1f3dc66d2e6802079193e713cb00a4bf7fcfedcfd9f0f5f9427d95d1034e492:6;\" style=\"width:62.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">及单质硫。</p><p>下列说法正确的是</p><p>A. 溶解等物质的量的<img src=\"chem-asset:c126949c8e90db2f25af844ac67fcc1731c45505f8cb254f4d25291f0aa76f1e:0;\" style=\"width:31.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:43edd39c8f6147164ecbbc73d6f7a72b38be28fd018e4b123c79230b9fab08f4:7;\" style=\"width:43.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">时，消耗<img src=\"chem-asset:0abe411c98b5a06091735d4e2880560c1ec8832b7575d283c12ce3eef6d3db62:8;\" style=\"width:31.47px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">物质的量之比为<img src=\"chem-asset:a48ed5c4df0b469300224889db3ec281615474f9a5da9e0e8169df7c19f2ea83:9;\" style=\"width:26.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>B. “电解I”阳极产物用尾液吸收后可在“热浸”中循环使用</p><p>C. “置换”中选用的试剂X可为Fe</p><p>D. “电解II”中将富银铅泥制成电极板，用作阴极</p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】B</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【分析】本题以铅精矿(含<img src=\"chem-asset:c126949c8e90db2f25af844ac67fcc1731c45505f8cb254f4d25291f0aa76f1e:0;\" style=\"width:31.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，<img src=\"chem-asset:927164707f7efbdda87f2bd141b6d3da020024e2a328962c8d01040439306ac9:10;\" style=\"width:39.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">等)为主要原料提取金属<img src=\"chem-asset:054b7a4aa2b78fa7eb1fc4fadf9cf79ea365fe725f1880424f903850ca9de475:2;\" style=\"width:22.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:a12c5dc927d8fb99210cb5ba8898aab8c2f75b2ec4c53e6a86be445af4bc6fcc:3;\" style=\"width:24.93px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">， “热浸”时，难溶的<img src=\"chem-asset:c126949c8e90db2f25af844ac67fcc1731c45505f8cb254f4d25291f0aa76f1e:0;\" style=\"width:31.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:927164707f7efbdda87f2bd141b6d3da020024e2a328962c8d01040439306ac9:10;\" style=\"width:39.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">转化为<img src=\"chem-asset:70da86b3429989569943b254dac68a477374c2ba8458c87eb0c2ed8c16c6edc6:11;\" style=\"width:62.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:8d326eab396ba3e8d46cb3a99c6bb80c155793b571cb789bce17277436f57443:12;\" style=\"width:60.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">及单质硫，<img src=\"chem-asset:449a89244baf15d38465908b213d04e17a640de75499788db70d74c974c1b4c9:13;\" style=\"width:31.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">被还原为<img src=\"chem-asset:5162aaf27cc139b586d6733034aee0642a48e49fbb8ee3af57882aa74383ba95:14;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，过滤I除掉单质硫滤渣，滤液中<img src=\"chem-asset:70da86b3429989569943b254dac68a477374c2ba8458c87eb0c2ed8c16c6edc6:11;\" style=\"width:62.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">在稀释降温的过程中转化为<img src=\"chem-asset:80d1a124a027afe68485e8dfc985dac6e1a400fc69fa42d83fcd10611032553e:15;\" style=\"width:42.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">沉淀，然后“热溶”使<img src=\"chem-asset:80d1a124a027afe68485e8dfc985dac6e1a400fc69fa42d83fcd10611032553e:15;\" style=\"width:42.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">又转化为<img src=\"chem-asset:70da86b3429989569943b254dac68a477374c2ba8458c87eb0c2ed8c16c6edc6:11;\" style=\"width:62.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，电解得到<img src=\"chem-asset:054b7a4aa2b78fa7eb1fc4fadf9cf79ea365fe725f1880424f903850ca9de475:2;\" style=\"width:22.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">；过滤II后的滤液成分主要为<img src=\"chem-asset:8d326eab396ba3e8d46cb3a99c6bb80c155793b571cb789bce17277436f57443:12;\" style=\"width:60.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:f12b29ffe574bcd6dff4bee2bbb38b2d84814e262ff4ed940404f32db20cdea4:16;\" style=\"width:41.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:8a387208e9d4a27ea4d52ff2446857996fbac9c9c632e2f517b1cce122c262f9:17;\" style=\"width:41.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，故加入铅精矿主要将<img src=\"chem-asset:8a387208e9d4a27ea4d52ff2446857996fbac9c9c632e2f517b1cce122c262f9:17;\" style=\"width:41.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">还原为<img src=\"chem-asset:f12b29ffe574bcd6dff4bee2bbb38b2d84814e262ff4ed940404f32db20cdea4:16;\" style=\"width:41.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，试剂X将<img src=\"chem-asset:8d326eab396ba3e8d46cb3a99c6bb80c155793b571cb789bce17277436f57443:12;\" style=\"width:60.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">置换为<img src=\"chem-asset:a12c5dc927d8fb99210cb5ba8898aab8c2f75b2ec4c53e6a86be445af4bc6fcc:3;\" style=\"width:24.93px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，得到富银铅泥，试剂X为铅，尾液为<img src=\"chem-asset:f12b29ffe574bcd6dff4bee2bbb38b2d84814e262ff4ed940404f32db20cdea4:16;\" style=\"width:41.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">。</p><p>【详解】A．热浸时，<img src=\"chem-asset:2ec37961126e014df198225281509ca4ff23c3a2ba436acd88867817922e6498:18;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">做氧化剂，<img src=\"chem-asset:bae5948b0dded89f8d6ca5bb78c36ff5e2048b18f8d81bf7b8c513b72df58c36:19;\" style=\"width:24.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">被氧化为<img src=\"chem-asset:b79d45102b290c00baca4c3f22039dcd9aac95b5f27cabc0de6883e50d1c42cf:20;\" style=\"width:14.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">单质，每<img src=\"chem-asset:11de3bdb6a98778249998ef91007828145ca3e779281819e189bdb5511636aff:21;\" style=\"width:64.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">反应，<img src=\"chem-asset:6fa3d982969ba2f86984ea2db637660de2e94efc6b8e078fcbc6cb19cb42f1ac:22;\" style=\"width:13.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">升<img src=\"chem-asset:3d613cbd057e9af6a8c8cb1702692dfc79ab5d8b93adf67c5815f59226350166:23;\" style=\"width:13.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">价，消耗</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:9a95bb4955243bb5ceb5e547c28471d341dd461d500bd913c48e3c6b5d6ce342:24;\" style=\"width:68.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">；每<img src=\"chem-asset:9f3dcbf6fa88825a46f763a01924e1c08c7e75c94d09334355724c087da2f409:25;\" style=\"width:72.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">反应，<img src=\"chem-asset:6fa3d982969ba2f86984ea2db637660de2e94efc6b8e078fcbc6cb19cb42f1ac:22;\" style=\"width:13.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">同样升<img src=\"chem-asset:3d613cbd057e9af6a8c8cb1702692dfc79ab5d8b93adf67c5815f59226350166:23;\" style=\"width:13.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">价，也消耗<img src=\"chem-asset:9a95bb4955243bb5ceb5e547c28471d341dd461d500bd913c48e3c6b5d6ce342:24;\" style=\"width:68.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，因此消耗<img src=\"chem-asset:0abe411c98b5a06091735d4e2880560c1ec8832b7575d283c12ce3eef6d3db62:8;\" style=\"width:31.47px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">物质的量之比为<img src=\"chem-asset:ce9b4ccfc00d6d79a1d68342e08bc1e2be1099bc54cba55278f285413b82e279:26;\" style=\"width:24.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，A错误；</p><p>B．“电解I”中，阴极<img src=\"chem-asset:70da86b3429989569943b254dac68a477374c2ba8458c87eb0c2ed8c16c6edc6:11;\" style=\"width:62.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">得电子生成金属<img src=\"chem-asset:054b7a4aa2b78fa7eb1fc4fadf9cf79ea365fe725f1880424f903850ca9de475:2;\" style=\"width:22.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，阳极<img src=\"chem-asset:f2c7ad6a8fcf0daef188ccad5646a630a9952afac88945218d33c7591871e3e2:27;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">失电子生成<img src=\"chem-asset:0abe411c98b5a06091735d4e2880560c1ec8832b7575d283c12ce3eef6d3db62:8;\" style=\"width:31.47px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">（或<img src=\"chem-asset:8cc2a11bebba83fe8d6499c831900e9142ca6d43fd7ccc63f450c2187cfd594f:28;\" style=\"width:24.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">失电子生成<img src=\"chem-asset:60abb02be9894c8e2674d5fbc394529e2449dfc644810dd41379e46b6c33f652:29;\" style=\"width:24.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">​，<img src=\"chem-asset:60abb02be9894c8e2674d5fbc394529e2449dfc644810dd41379e46b6c33f652:29;\" style=\"width:24.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">氧化<img src=\"chem-asset:f2c7ad6a8fcf0daef188ccad5646a630a9952afac88945218d33c7591871e3e2:27;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">得到<img src=\"chem-asset:0abe411c98b5a06091735d4e2880560c1ec8832b7575d283c12ce3eef6d3db62:8;\" style=\"width:31.47px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">），<img src=\"chem-asset:0abe411c98b5a06091735d4e2880560c1ec8832b7575d283c12ce3eef6d3db62:8;\" style=\"width:31.47px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">是“热浸”步骤的原料，因此阳极产物处理后可在热浸中循环使用，B正确；</p><p>C．若置换试剂<img src=\"chem-asset:47fbce1ef96fc174720b6a99513424320120996f12dc4c17616f7b2e2578d353:30;\" style=\"width:17.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">为<img src=\"chem-asset:f7c8510051def097739d7e1ef6d786ee020a3662e324203c45651ce60fabc1d9:31;\" style=\"width:21.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，<img src=\"chem-asset:f7c8510051def097739d7e1ef6d786ee020a3662e324203c45651ce60fabc1d9:31;\" style=\"width:21.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">比<img src=\"chem-asset:a12c5dc927d8fb99210cb5ba8898aab8c2f75b2ec4c53e6a86be445af4bc6fcc:3;\" style=\"width:24.93px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:054b7a4aa2b78fa7eb1fc4fadf9cf79ea365fe725f1880424f903850ca9de475:2;\" style=\"width:22.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">都活泼，会置换出<img src=\"chem-asset:a12c5dc927d8fb99210cb5ba8898aab8c2f75b2ec4c53e6a86be445af4bc6fcc:3;\" style=\"width:24.93px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:054b7a4aa2b78fa7eb1fc4fadf9cf79ea365fe725f1880424f903850ca9de475:2;\" style=\"width:22.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，还会引入<img src=\"chem-asset:f7c8510051def097739d7e1ef6d786ee020a3662e324203c45651ce60fabc1d9:31;\" style=\"width:21.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">杂质，影响后续提纯；<img src=\"chem-asset:47fbce1ef96fc174720b6a99513424320120996f12dc4c17616f7b2e2578d353:30;\" style=\"width:17.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">应选<img src=\"chem-asset:054b7a4aa2b78fa7eb1fc4fadf9cf79ea365fe725f1880424f903850ca9de475:2;\" style=\"width:22.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，置换出<img src=\"chem-asset:a12c5dc927d8fb99210cb5ba8898aab8c2f75b2ec4c53e6a86be445af4bc6fcc:3;\" style=\"width:24.93px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">且不引入新杂质，C错误；</p><p>D．“电解II”需要从富银铅泥中提纯<img src=\"chem-asset:a12c5dc927d8fb99210cb5ba8898aab8c2f75b2ec4c53e6a86be445af4bc6fcc:3;\" style=\"width:24.93px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:054b7a4aa2b78fa7eb1fc4fadf9cf79ea365fe725f1880424f903850ca9de475:2;\" style=\"width:22.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，类似电解精炼，需要将粗的富银铅泥作阳极（阳极溶解，金属离子进入电解液，纯金属在阴极析出），因此富银铅泥应作阳极，不是阴极，D错误；</p><p>故答案选B。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.5.8\\精品解析：湖南长沙市第一中学2025-2026学年高三下学期4月阶段检测 化学试题\\精品解析：湖南长沙市第一中学2025-2026学年高三下学期4月阶段检测 化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.5.8/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62025-2026%E5%AD%A6%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F4%E6%9C%88%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62025-2026%E5%AD%A6%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F4%E6%9C%88%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%